{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20989","headline":"猛虎行 · 李贺","name":"猛虎行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长戈莫舂，长弩莫抨。\n乳孙哺子，教得生狞。\n举头爲城，掉尾爲旌。\n东海黄公，愁见夜行。\n道逢驺虞，牛哀不平。\n何用尺刀，壁上雷鸣。\n泰山之下，妇人哭声。\n官家有程，吏不敢听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}